{
  "title": "KEIT — Scaleway Carbon Hotspots",
  "tags": [
    "keit",
    "sustainability",
    "scaleway",
    "carbon",
    "hotspots",
    "findings",
    "reusable"
  ],
  "editable": true,
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "refresh": "1h",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-14d",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(keit_scaleway_co2_kg, kubernetes_cluster)",
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".+",
        "multi": true,
        "label": "Cluster",
        "name": "cluster",
        "query": "label_values(keit_scaleway_co2_kg, kubernetes_cluster)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "type": "query",
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        }
      },
      {
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(keit_scaleway_co2_kg, project_name)",
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".+",
        "multi": true,
        "label": "Project",
        "name": "project",
        "query": "label_values(keit_scaleway_co2_kg, project_name)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "type": "query"
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": 100,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "> ℹ️ **Reusable dashboard from KEIT** — see [github.com/aknostic/keit/grafana/dashboards](https://github.com/aknostic/keit/tree/main/grafana/dashboards) for the source and other reusable dashboards.\n\n## Where is my carbon footprint actually concentrated?\n\nThis dashboard helps you find your **hotspots** — projects, resource types, and regions that dominate your Scaleway emissions. You don't need precise SCI to act on these. Look at the top-ranked items, ask *should this be this big?*, take action.\n\n**What's a SKU?** Scaleway's term for a Stock Keeping Unit: a (service · machine type · zone) triple. Example: `/compute/dev1_m/run_pl-waw-1` = \"DEV1-M instances running in Warsaw zone 1\". One SKU bundles all your resources of that type in that zone — so per-instance attribution from this API alone isn't possible.\n\n**Designed to be reusable**: works on any org with the `keit_scaleway_co2_kg` exporter installed. Drop it into your own Grafana."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "id": 101,
      "title": "What dominates",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "description": "Which Scaleway projects emit the most? The top 1–2 usually dominate. Pareto applies to carbon too.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "kgCO2eq",
          "decimals": 2
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 7
      },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "values": [
            "value",
            "percent"
          ]
        },
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "pieType": "donut"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (project_name) (keit_scaleway_co2_kg{project_name=~\"$project\"}) / scalar(count(count by (report_date)(keit_scaleway_co2_kg{project_name=~\"$project\"}))) * ($__range_s / 86400)",
          "legendFormat": "{{project_name}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Top projects (over dashboard range)",
      "type": "piechart"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "description": "Which RESOURCE TYPES dominate, across all your projects? Compute? Storage? Network? This tells you which class of resource to look at first.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "kgCO2eq",
          "decimals": 2
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 7
      },
      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "values": [
            "value",
            "percent"
          ]
        },
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (service_category) (keit_scaleway_co2_kg{project_name=~\"$project\"}) / scalar(count(count by (report_date)(keit_scaleway_co2_kg{project_name=~\"$project\"}))) * ($__range_s / 86400)",
          "legendFormat": "{{service_category}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Emissions by service category",
      "type": "piechart"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "description": "Top 10 SKUs. SKU = (service · machine type · zone) triple, e.g. `/compute/dev1_m/run_pl-waw-1` is 'DEV1-M instances in Warsaw zone 1'. This is where the lever lives: if one SKU dominates, that's your concentration point.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "kgCO2eq",
          "decimals": 2,
          "custom": {
            "align": "left"
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 12,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 15
      },
      "id": 3,
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "footer": {
          "show": false
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "topk(10, sum by (sku, project_name) (keit_scaleway_co2_kg{project_name=~\"$project\"}) / scalar(count(count by (report_date)(keit_scaleway_co2_kg{project_name=~\"$project\"}))) * ($__range_s / 86400))",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Top 10 SKUs by emissions (project · SKU)",
      "type": "table",
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "project_name": "Project",
              "sku": "SKU",
              "Value": "kgCO2eq (over range)"
            },
            "indexByName": {
              "project_name": 0,
              "sku": 1,
              "Value": 2
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "sortBy",
          "options": {
            "fields": {},
            "sort": [
              {
                "field": "kgCO2eq (over range)",
                "desc": true
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "id": 102,
      "title": "The regional grid effect (often the biggest lever)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 27
      },
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "description": "Same machine TYPE across different zones. Each row is a machine type (e.g. dev1_m, pro2_s, loadbalancer-s); each column is a Scaleway zone. The contrast between a column in Warsaw (pl-waw, coal-heavy grid) and the same row in Paris (fr-par, nuclear) is often 20×+ for the SAME machine. **Region choice often beats tier choice.**",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "kgCO2eq",
          "decimals": 2,
          "custom": {
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "color-background",
              "mode": "gradient"
            },
            "align": "center",
            "minWidth": 110
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "continuous-YlRd"
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "sku_type"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "auto"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.align",
                "value": "left"
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.minWidth",
                "value": 220
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 14,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 28
      },
      "id": 4,
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "md"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (sku_type, zone) (label_replace(keit_scaleway_co2_kg{project_name=~\"$project\",service_category=~\"compute|network\"}, \"sku_type\", \"$1\", \"sku\", \"(/[^/]+/[^/]+)/.*\"))",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Same machine, different zones — heatmap (red = more emissions)",
      "type": "table",
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "groupingToMatrix",
          "options": {
            "columnField": "zone",
            "rowField": "sku_type",
            "valueField": "Value"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "id": 103,
      "title": "Trends & regression detection",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 42
      },
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "description": "Rolling 14-day emissions sum per project, over time. An upward step = a recent day's emissions came in higher than the day that just rolled off the window. A decay = a high day has aged out. Compute usually flat; storage trends upward (no lifecycle policy = monotonic). Note: early data points (<10 May) reflect the period when the Scaleway exporter was being iterated on — treat with caution.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "kgCO2eq",
          "decimals": 2,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 30,
            "lineInterpolation": "stepAfter",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 43
      },
      "id": 5,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (project_name) (keit_scaleway_co2_kg{project_name=~\"$project\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{project_name}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Rolling 14-day sum by project (steps up = recent regression; decay = high day aged out)",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "description": "Storage emissions grow with data volume. A bucket without a lifecycle policy is a one-way valve. Look for storage SKUs trending upward and ask: do those buckets have retention rules?",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "kgCO2eq",
          "decimals": 3,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 30,
            "lineInterpolation": "stepAfter"
          }
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 53
      },
      "id": 6,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "topk(8, sum by (sku) (keit_scaleway_co2_kg{project_name=~\"$project\",service_category=\"storage\"}))",
          "legendFormat": "{{sku}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Top 8 storage SKUs over time (check for monotonic growth = no lifecycle policy)",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "id": 104,
      "title": "Pipeline health",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 63
      },
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "description": "How many days behind is the Scaleway API right now? 0 = yesterday's data is fresh. Higher = data pipeline lag at Scaleway's side. If this climbs above your trust threshold, fall back to the last fresh window for decisions.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "d",
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 2
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 5
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 64
      },
      "id": 7,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "max(keit_scaleway_data_lag_days)",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Data lag (days)",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "description": "Is the exporter scraping successfully? 0 = something is wrong (auth, network, Scaleway API down). When 0, gauges hold their last-known-good values.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "FAIL"
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "OK"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 64
      },
      "id": 8,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "min(keit_scaleway_scrape_success)",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Exporter health",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "description": "How many distinct (project, region, SKU) entries Scaleway is currently reporting for. Drops in this number can indicate workload was decommissioned (good) or the exporter is missing data (investigate).",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 64
      },
      "id": 9,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "count(count by (sku, project_name)(keit_scaleway_co2_kg{project_name=~\"$project\"}))",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Active (project · SKU) entries",
      "type": "stat"
    }
  ],
  "__inputs": [
    {
      "name": "DS_PROMETHEUS",
      "label": "Prometheus / Mimir",
      "description": "Prometheus-compatible datasource (Mimir, Cortex, Thanos, or vanilla Prometheus) where the KEIT metrics are ingested.",
      "type": "datasource",
      "pluginId": "prometheus",
      "pluginName": "Prometheus"
    }
  ],
  "__requires": [
    {
      "type": "grafana",
      "id": "grafana",
      "name": "Grafana",
      "version": "9.0.0"
    },
    {
      "type": "datasource",
      "id": "prometheus",
      "name": "Prometheus",
      "version": "1.0.0"
    }
  ],
  "uid": "keit-scaleway-hotspots"
}